# CRKD Gibson Les Paul guitar controller (0351:4161), firmware v3.
#
# The whammy bar reports a 16-bit value on ABS_Z, 0 at rest to 65280 fully
# pressed in steps of 256, while xpad declares the axis as a 10-bit trigger
# (0..1023). Anything past 1.5% of the bar's travel therefore reads as fully
# pressed. Measured with evtest on 2026-09-11.
#
# The tilt sensor shares the axis, sending a fixed 255 while tilted, which is
# 0.4% of the corrected range and so no longer reads as the whammy held.
evdev:input:b0003v0351p4161*
 EVDEV_ABS_02=0:65280:0:0:0
